  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let centre of circle be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p>It lies in line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>4</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/58ca2f01-795e-4af4-9ad6-7df256d2811e-image.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 230px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi></math></p><p>By distance formula,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>48</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>64</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>64</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>64</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>48</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>40</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>40</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>C</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>",
